  "direction": "4h UTC long-only spot time-series momentum with same-slot relative quote-volume confirmation",
  "hypothesis": "An intermediate 4h close-to-close momentum signal confirmed by elevated same-slot quote turnover may avoid low-liquidity false entries; compare 6/12/24-bar momentum and volume ratios 1.00/1.25/1.50 on BTC and ETH.",
