  "rule": "For completed UTC 4h bar i, define momentum as close[i-1]/close[i-1-lookback]-1. Compute relative volume as quote_volume[i-1] divided by the arithmetic mean of quote_volume from the prior 20 observations of the same UTC 4h slot (i-7, i-13, ..., i-121); current bar is excluded. Flat enters when momentum>0 and relative volume>=threshold. Long exits when momentum<=0, regardless of volume. Otherwise retain desired state. Signals use closed bars only; execution at the next block start+1 minute open. No leverage, shorting, scale-in, rebalance, cross-asset transfer, or pre-OOS trades. Each asset/config has independent 2000 USDT initial cash.",
  "accounting": "Independent $2,000 account per asset/config. Preserve cash and units, maximum affordable buy, whole sale, no yield/rebalance. Terminal liquidation is costed.",
  "gates": {
    "all_1x_2x_3x_net_returns_positive": true,
    "minimum_positive_1x_folds": 7,
    "max_3x_minute_close_sample_drawdown_pct": 25,
    "min_3x_neighborhood_positive_fraction_per_asset": 0.6,
    "min_1x_round_trips": 2,
    "min_1x_gross_pnl_to_cost": 2.5,
    "no_balance_violations": true,
    "terminal_flat": true,
    "interpretation": "A pass is a repeated-history screen only; no independent/forward profitability claim."
  },
